      <p>It’s 2:15 PM on a Thursday afternoon. You’re staring at a spreadsheet or an email draft, and your brain feels completely stalled. For years, my default response was to walk to the breakroom and pour a third cup of coffee. But by 3:00 PM, all that extra caffeine gave me was jittery hands, a racing heart, and the exact same lack of mental clarity.</p>

      <p>Replacing that afternoon coffee break with a quick session on <a href="https://snappgrid.com/connections" style="color:var(--gold); font-weight:700;">SnappGrid Connections</a> or <a href="https://snappgrid.com/trivia" style="color:var(--gold); font-weight:700;">Daily Trivia</a> proved to be a game-changer:</p>

